{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-12-20 09:00:00', 'title': "HII'S PHAROS DEMONSTRATES LAUNCH AND RECOVERY\xa0WITH NAVY UNMANNED VEHICLE", 'text': "NEWPORT, R.I., DEC. 20, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- GLOBAL ALL-DOMAIN DEFENSE PARTNER HII (NYSE: HII) COLLABORATED WITH THE NAVY ON A RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT EFFORT THAT ADVANCED THE LAUNCH AND RECOVERY OF A LARGE SIZE UNMANNED UNDERSEA VEHICLE (UUV), USING AN AMPHIBIOUS SHIP AND HII'S PHAROS SYSTEM."}